  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is a quadratic equation whose roots are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></math> is equal to :"
